1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,920
Dua ibu bapa. Simpan RM8,000 yang sama.
Two parents. Same RM8,000 saved.

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:06,100
Seorang jimat cukai sehingga RM2,000.
One saves up to RM2,000 in tax.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:08,800
Bezanya tersembunyi dalam dua lajur.
The difference is hiding in two columns.

4
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:09,940
Perangkap pertama: keluarkan wang
Trap one: withdraw

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,720
pada tahun yang sama, termasuk dividen,
in the same year, even your dividends,

6
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,005
pelepasan anda berkurang.
and your relief shrinks.

7
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:17,180
Perangkap kedua: SSPN atas nama sendiri,
Trap two: an SSPN in your own name

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,980
pelepasan sifar.
gets zero relief.

9
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,730
Buat dengan betul, jimat sehingga
Do it right, and you save up to

10
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:25,750
RM2,000, ikut kadar cukai anda.
RM2,000, depending on your tax band.

11
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,970
Wang mesti sampai ke PTPTN
The money must reach PTPTN

12
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,830
sebelum 31 Disember.
by 31 December.

13
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:31,270
Bukan di kaunter?
Not paying at a counter?

14
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:33,119
Bayar sebelum 25 Disember.
Pay by the 25th.

